<hr size=2 width="100%" align=center> 

<p>
I am a Professor in the Department of Mathematics at <b><a href="https://www.math.ucsb.edu/">UCSB</a></b>.</br>
</p>

<p> 
Previously, I was an Instructor at <b><a href="https://www.math.princeton.edu/">Princeton University</a></b>, 
and before that, a Hedrick Assistant Professor at <b><a href="http://www.math.ucla.edu/">UCLA</a></b>. </br>

Here is my <b><a href="CV.pdf">CV</a></b> (last updated: September 2026).</br>
</p>

<p>
My research is partially supported by the NSF grant DMS-2401321. <!-- and by the <b><a href="https://www.ams.org/news?news_id=7272">2024-2025 AMS Centennial Research Fellowship</a></b>.-->
</p>

<hr size=2 width="100%" align=center> 

<p> 
I help organize the <b><a href="https://sites.google.com/view/seminarongeometryandarithmetic/">Seminar on Geometry and Arithmetic</a></b>
</p>


