<hr size=2 width="100%" align=center>


<!-- <hr size=2 width="100%" align=center>  -->

<p>
<b>Research Interests:</b> Number Theory and Arithmetic Geometry. </br>
More specifically: <i>p</i>-adic <i>L</i>-functions, Euler systems and Iwasawa theory. <br/> 
<!-- with a special emphasis on their applications to the arithmetic of elliptic curves. <br/> -->
</p>



